<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell four basis-points to 3.03 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 17 fix	  March 14 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.02 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.03 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.26 pct		3.26 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.37 pct		3.36 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
